# Machine-local GTK files — created/edited by apps and theming tools on each
# box, not stowed. Listed here so `stow gtk` (and install.sh) can't abort on
# them: one conflict aborts the WHOLE stow run.
\.config/gtk-3\.0/bookmarks$
\.config/gtk-3\.0/noctalia\.css$
\.config/gtk-4\.0/noctalia\.css$
\.stow-local-ignore$
